  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; ss by #6894-B, eff 12-1-98; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 500); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2208.05); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14025, eff 8-1-24",
